{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3787380/extras/\uc77c\ub7ec\uc2a4\ud2b86_-_\ubcf5\uc0ac\ubcf8.png?t=1749117888\" /><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3787380/extras/\uc77c\ub7ec\uc2a4\ud2b86.png?t=1749117888\" /><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3787380/extras/1-ezgif.com-video-to-gif-converter__1_.gif?t=1749117888\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>Chloe's adventure story!</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><i>'Astra Village'</i> is a heartful game about a cheerful girl named Chloe who sets out to restore a ruined village and inn.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Chloe will explore the areas around the village, farming and crafting essential items, helping the locals, and uncovering the hidden secrets that lie beneath the village's peaceful surface.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3787380/extras/\uc77c\ub7ec\uc2a4\ud2b86_-_\ubcf5\uc0ac\ubcf8.png?t=1749117888\" /><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3787380/extras/\uc77c\ub7ec\uc2a4\ud2b87.png?t=1749117888\" /><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3787380/extras/12112_converted.gif?t=1749117888\" /></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>Farming &amp; Gathering</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">To rebuild the village and inn, you\u2019ll need plenty of materials.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Gather resources through farming and foraging, then use them to repair and improve your surroundings! </p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3787380/extras/\uc77c\ub7ec\uc2a4\ud2b86_-_\ubcf5\uc0ac\ubcf8.png?t=1749117888\" /><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3787380/extras/\uc77c\ub7ec\uc2a4\ud2b88.png?t=1749117888\" /><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3787380/extras/6-ezgif.com-video-to-gif-converter.gif?t=1749117888\" /></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>Adventure &amp; Story</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Venture beyond the village and discover new environments and monsters!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Explore every corner to uncover hidden secrets and collect rare, valuable items.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3787380/extras/\uc77c\ub7ec\uc2a4\ud2b86_-_\ubcf5\uc0ac\ubcf8.png?t=1749117888\" /><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3787380/extras/\uc77c\ub7ec\uc2a4\ud2b89.png?t=1749117888\" /><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3787380/extras/12122_converted.gif?t=1749117888\" /></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>Crafting</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Need tools to help restore the village? There\u2019s a crafting system for that!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">At Astra Village\u2019s special w